# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Pamantasan Records Notifications
# 1. Create or use an official Gmail account (e.g. pamantasan.records.notify@gmail.com or noreply@plpasig.edu.ph)
# 2. Go to Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App Passwords
# 3. Create a 16-character App Password and paste below:

GMAIL_USER=pamantasan.records.notify@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password
SENDER_NAME=Pamantasan ng Lungsod ng Pasig - Records
